    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our LLM stack, RAG capabilities, fine-tuning methods, explainability tools, performance benchmarks, past AI use cases, and known trade-offs as of 2024, can our propose an AI solution that meets these requirements and provides a high level of relevance? our can propose an AI solution that leverages our LLM stack, specifically our preferred sovereign model Mistral 7B Instruct, which has strong French-language performance and is self-hostable." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To provide explainable recommendations or proposals, our can utilize our RAG capabilities, particularly the retrieval strategies such as Dense vector semantic and BM25 sparse, to fetch relevant information from internal procedures and applicable regulatory texts. our fine-tuning methods, including LoRA and QLoRA, can be applied to adapt the model to the specific domain tone and format. our can also use our explainability tools, such as Source citation, Chain-of-thought display, SHAP for classification models, and LIME, to provide insights into the decision-making process." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To recall applicable rules and suggest actions or verifications to carry out, our can integrate our solution with existing practices of agents and leverage our experience in past AI use cases, such as regulatory document Q&A assistants and contract review and clause extraction." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of performance benchmarks, our typical retrieval precision at 5 is 0.87, and our typical answer relevance score is 0.84, which indicates a high level of relevance. our can also optimize the model performance by using quantization methods such as INT8 and GGUF to reduce energy consumption while maintaining comparable task performance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, based on our company context and capabilities, our believe that our solution can meet the client's requirements, providing explainable recommendations or proposals, assisting agents in agents daily missions, and recalling applicable rules and suggesting actions or verifications to carry out, all while achieving a high level of relevance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

