        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To contribute to reducing energetic consumption, our company's can propose the use of our company's green hosting partners, such as OVHcloud and Scaleway, both located in France and using 100% renewable energy. our green hosting partners, such as OVHcloud and Scaleway, both located in France and using 100% renewable energy Power Usage Effectiveness (PUE) values are 1.3 and 1.28 respectively, indicating efficient energy use. our company's digital sobriety practices include INT8/INT4 model quantisation to reduce GPU energy consumption by approximately 40%, auto-scaling to zero outside business hours, query result caching to reduce recomputation by around 20%, and a green IT hardware procurement policy with a minimum 5-year lifecycle." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our digital sobriety practices can help minimize the carbon footprint of our solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our company's can highlight our company's social commitments, including a gender equality index of 88, a disabled workers percentage of 4.2, local subcontracting preference, accessibility standards compliance (WCAG 2.1 AA and RGAA 4.1), and an average of 42 training hours per employee per year. our company's AI ethics principles include human oversight for all AI recommendations, quarterly bias testing to prevent discriminatory outputs, transparency of data sources, and the right to contest any AI-generated suggestion." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk127> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our AI ethics principles can help ensure that our solution is not only environmentally sustainable but also socially responsible." ;
