    <http://example.org/node/chunk128> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, our company's are aware of known sustainability trade-offs, such as the tension between high availability and energy consumption. our company's standard resolution for the tension between high availability and energy consumption is to use low-power standby mode with a wake-up time of less than 90 seconds, which is compatible with our company's SLA requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk129> a prov:Entity ;
